OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FLionel Messi has said he is not sure
OL,8,Fhow long he will continue playing
OL,9,Ffootball as he shared a heartfelt
OL,10,Ftribute to his late father on social
OL,11,Fmedia.
OL,13,FJorge Messi, 68, is reported to have
OL,14,Fdied in Rosario on Friday night, after
OL,15,Fbattling long-term illness.
OL,17,FAs part of the post, which has over
OL,18,Fsix million likes on Instagram, the
OL,19,FMessi wrote: "I don't know how to
OL,20,Fcarry on.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786609104
OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,F"I used to just play football, and now
OL,8,FI'm really not sure if I'll carry on
OL,9,Fdoing it for much longer.
OL,11,F"You were by my side from the
OL,12,Fbeginning; there was so little left
OL,13,Funtil the end. Why couldn't you hold
OL,14,Fon just a little longer so we could
OL,15,Ffinish it together?"
OL,17,FThe Argentine forward added: "I know
OL,18,Fyou were suffering and that this is
OL,19,Ffor the best, but you left too soon.
OL,20,FWe still had a lot left to enjoy
OL,21,Ftogether."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
