PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786609104
OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FMessi captioned the statement "Te amo,
OL,8,Fpa", which translates to I love you
OL,9,Fdad.
OL,11,F"I'm going to miss you so much, but
OL,12,Fyou'll always be present, especially
OL,13,Fin bringing up my children, because
OL,14,FI'm teaching and raising them as you
OL,15,Fboth did with me," he wrote.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786609104
OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,F"Rest in peace and look after us from
OL,8,Fup there, just as you did here. Thank
OL,9,Fyou for everything."
OL,11,FJorge Messi was a hugely influential
OL,12,Ffigure during his son's early career
OL,13,Fand also worked as his agent.
OL,15,FArgentine sports club, Newell's Old
OL,16,FBoys, said in a statement after his
OL,17,Fdeath: "Jorge was the support and the
OL,18,Fperson who underpinned with vision,
OL,19,Frigor and affection the career of the
OL,20,Fbest player of all time together with
OL,21,Fhis wife, Celia Cuccittini.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
