PN,31205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786609104
OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,F"His constant accompaniment and
OL,8,Fleadership behind the scenes were
OL,9,Ffundamental to support Lionel's every
OL,10,Fstep, from his beginnings in Malvinas
OL,11,Fto the maximum glory of world
OL,12,Ffootball. Thank you for teaching him
OL,13,Fto love these colours.
OL,15,F"The Board of Directors, members,
OL,16,Fathletes and the entire leproso family
OL,17,Fembrace with affection Celia, Lionel,
OL,18,FRodrigo, Matias and Maria Sol and all
OL,19,Ftheir loved ones and relatives in this
OL,20,Fdifficult time."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
