OL,3,CMessi 'not sure' how much longer he
OL,4,Cwill play football following father's
OL,5,Cdeath
OL,7,FFootballer Messi led Argentina to the
OL,8,F2026 Fifa World Cup final this year,
OL,9,Flosing 1-0 to Spain, before returning
OL,10,Fto Inter Miami.
OL,12,FThe Messi family had released a
OL,13,Fstatement during the tournament to say
OL,14,Fthat Jorge Messi had been "under
OL,15,Fmedical monitoring, recovering and
OL,16,Fevolving favourably within the
OL,17,Fcondition he presents".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
